<br><br>
Surface Nonmetal Mine <br>
(Sand and Gravel)
<br><br>

Fatal Powered Haulage Accident<br>
July 21, 2005
<br><br>

Matthewsville Excavating<br>
Matthewsville Gravel Pit<br>
Pima, Graham County, Arizona<br>
Mine I.D. No. 02-02880

<br><br>
Investigators 
<br>

Thomas E. Barrington<br>
Mine Safety and Health Inspector 
<br><br>
